  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Evolution is a competitive co-polyester monofilament developed from years of material expertise gained through the Pro Line family. Its specially engineered textured surface with optimized peaks enhances ball grip, spin, slice and power transfer while maintaining strong control and predictable playability. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes spin and feel, while the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability, stability and control for powerful hitters.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Evolution 是一款面向竞技球员的共聚酯单丝球线，其材料开发建立在 Kirschbaum Pro Line 系列多年的配方经验之上。特殊纹理表面与优化凸点结构能够显著增强咬球能力，从而提升旋转、切削以及力量传递，同时保持稳定控制和优秀可打性。1.25毫米版本更强调旋转、手感和咬球；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久、稳定与重击控制。"
  },

